      "Monthly pension; Rs.1,200 was listed on the Revenue Administration table as of March 2024.",
      ["Applicant is a widow meeting destitution and residence requirements.", "Published information lists a minimum age of 18 and a fixed-assets limit of Rs.1 lakh; confirm current rules and exceptions."], [],
      [B("pension", "Monthly pension through the state's approved payment system.", 1200, "monthly", "historical", "CRA table (as of March 2024); current order not confirmed.")],
      [D("Applicant photograph", "required"), D("Aadhaar card", "required"), D("Aadhaar consent form", "required"), D("Smart / ration card or any address proof", "required"), D("Husband's death certificate", "required"), D("Self-declaration of applicant", "required"), D("Widow certificate", "required"), D("Identity proof (Voter ID, passport, PAN, driving licence)", "required"), D("Bank passbook", "required")],
      ["Contact the Taluk Office or an authorised e-Sevai centre.", "Submit the prescribed application and widow-status records.", "Complete financial and eligibility verification and track the status."],
      "https://oap.tn.gov.in/", "https://oap.tn.gov.in/", [("https://www.tnesevai.tn.gov.in/Pages/ServiceList.aspx", "e-Sevai Service List: DWPS, row 84"), ("https://oap.tn.gov.in/", "Social security pensions portal")],
